This product bundles no third-party source. It depends at run time on
packages listed in requirements.txt, each under its own license, and on two
model weights downloaded at setup time:

  ultralytics (YOLO11)      AGPL-3.0        https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics
  ultralytics-thop          AGPL-3.0        https://github.com/ultralytics/thop
  google/siglip2-base-patch16-256
                            Apache-2.0      https://huggingface.co/google/siglip2-base-patch16-256

Note that Ultralytics YOLO11 is AGPL-3.0. Using it in a network service that
you distribute or offer to others may oblige you to release the source of that
service under the AGPL, or to obtain a commercial license from Ultralytics.
Swapping the detector is a contained change (see humanmonitor/detector.py) if
that obligation is unwanted.
